## Troubleshooting Checklist

| Issue | Check |
|-------|-------|
| Calls not arriving | Verify Plivo Inbound Trunk Primary URI points to your LiveKit FQDN on port 5060 |
| "Trunk not found" / 404 | Ensure **Allowed Addresses** in LiveKit includes Plivo's signaling IPs |
| 401 / 407 Unauthorized on outbound | Check Username and Password match the Plivo Credentials List exactly |
| 403 Forbidden | Verify your LiveKit server IP is in Plivo's IP ACL |
| Calls into India fail | Confirm trunk is region-pinned to BOM (Mumbai) or SIN (Singapore) |
| One-way audio | Confirm UDP/RTP ports are open in your cloud firewall and `use_external_ip: true` is set in `livekit-sip` config if behind NAT |
| No room created | Check dispatch rule is linked to the correct trunk ID |
| High latency / lag | Verify the trunk's PoP is in a region close to your LiveKit server |
| Outbound dialing wrong number | Check the **Numbers** field on your LiveKit Outbound Trunk matches your Plivo DID |

