## Quick Reference: Configuration Summary

**Plivo Side:**
```
Zentrunk:
  → Credentials List: livekit_user / [password]
  → IP ACL: Your LiveKit Server Public IP

Outbound Trunk: LiveKit Outbound
  → Linked to: Credentials List + IP ACL
  → Region (PoP): CA / VA / FRA / BOM / SIN / SYD / GRU
  → Outbound Domain: mytrunk.outbound.plivo.com (auto-issued)

Inbound Trunk: LiveKit Inbound
  → Primary URI: sip:your-livekit-server.com:5060

Numbers:
  → Assigned via Phone Numbers → Your Numbers → Application Type: Zentrunk
```

**LiveKit Side:**
```
Inbound Trunk:
  → Name: Plivo Inbound
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Numbers: Your Plivo DID
  → Allowed Addresses: Plivo's regional signaling IPs
  → Auth: None (IP-based)

Dispatch Rule:
  → Linked to: Plivo Inbound trunk
  → Type: Direct/Individual/Multi-Line (your choice)
  → Agent: Your AI agent

Outbound Trunk:
  → Name: Plivo Outbound
  → Address: [Your Plivo outbound domain from Console]
  → Transport: UDP
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Auth: Credentials List username + password
  → Numbers: Your Plivo DID
```

